<title>ZAIRE: Kabila arrives in Kinshasa.</title>
<headline>Kabila arrives in Kinshasa.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laurent Kabila landed in Kinshasa on Tuesday, four days after his rebel army swept Zaire's president Mobutu Sese Seko from power and Kabila proclaimed himself president of the renamed Democratic Republic of Congo, witnesses said.</p>
</text>
